graph TB
    subgraph "Garak Provider (Eval-Hub Adapter)"
        direction TB

        subgraph "evalhub Package"
            GarakAdapter["GarakAdapter<br/>(FrameworkAdapter)<br/>Simple mode orchestration"]
            GarakKFPAdapter["GarakKFPAdapter<br/>(FrameworkAdapter)<br/>Forces KFP execution"]
            KFPPipeline["evalhub_garak_pipeline<br/>(6-step KFP Pipeline)"]
            S3Utils["s3_utils<br/>Artifact transfer"]
            GarakKFPAdapter -->|subclass of| GarakAdapter
            GarakKFPAdapter -->|submits| KFPPipeline
            GarakAdapter -->|uses| S3Utils
        end

        subgraph "core Package"
            ConfigResolution["config_resolution<br/>Profile merging &<br/>precedence logic"]
            PipelineSteps["pipeline_steps<br/>Framework-agnostic<br/>step logic"]
            GarakRunner["garak_runner<br/>Subprocess mgmt<br/>timeout/shutdown"]
            CommandBuilder["command_builder<br/>CLI & generator<br/>option builder"]
        end

        subgraph "Support Modules"
            ResultUtils["result_utils<br/>JSONL/AVID parsing<br/>ART HTML reports"]
            SDG["sdg<br/>Synthetic Data<br/>Generation wrapper"]
            Intents["intents<br/>Policy taxonomy<br/>& prompt datasets"]
            GarakCmdConfig["garak_command_config<br/>Pydantic config models"]
        end

        GarakAdapter -->|delegates to| PipelineSteps
        GarakAdapter -->|launches| GarakRunner
        GarakAdapter -->|reads config via| ConfigResolution
        GarakAdapter -->|builds commands via| CommandBuilder
        GarakAdapter -->|parses results via| ResultUtils
        PipelineSteps -->|uses| SDG
        PipelineSteps -->|uses| Intents
        PipelineSteps -->|uses| CommandBuilder
        PipelineSteps -->|uses| GarakCmdConfig
        KFPPipeline -->|runs steps from| PipelineSteps
    end

    %% External interactions
    EvalHub["eval-hub Service<br/>(sidecar)"]
    JobSpec["JobSpec<br/>(ConfigMap mount)"]
    ModelEndpoint["Model Inference<br/>Endpoint"]
    GarakBin["Garak 0.15.0+rhaiv.5<br/>(subprocess)"]

    JobSpec -->|read by| GarakAdapter
    GarakAdapter -->|callbacks| EvalHub
    GarakRunner -->|launches| GarakBin
    GarakBin -->|probes| ModelEndpoint

    OCI["OCI Registry"]
    MLflow["MLflow Tracking"]
    S3["S3 Storage"]
    KFP["Kubeflow Pipelines API"]

    GarakAdapter -->|persists artifacts| OCI
    GarakAdapter -->|logs metrics| MLflow
    GarakKFPAdapter -->|submits pipeline| KFP
    S3Utils -->|upload/download| S3

    %% Styling
    style GarakAdapter fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style GarakKFPAdapter fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style KFPPipeline fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ConfigResolution fill:#5bb5e0,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style PipelineSteps fill:#5bb5e0,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style GarakRunner fill:#5bb5e0,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style CommandBuilder fill:#5bb5e0,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ResultUtils fill:#7ecbe0,stroke:#333
    style SDG fill:#7ecbe0,stroke:#333
    style Intents fill:#7ecbe0,stroke:#333
    style GarakCmdConfig fill:#7ecbe0,stroke:#333
    style S3Utils fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style EvalHub fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style JobSpec fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style ModelEndpoint fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style GarakBin fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style OCI fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style MLflow fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style S3 fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style KFP fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
